From: FlyWeb <noreply@lamosquita.net>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:06:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move FlyWeb's cookie store tests to brave_unit_tests

net_unittests does not build in a brave tree (cookie_monster_unittest.cc
against ChromiumCookieMonster), so UndecryptableFw1DropsOnlyItsRow and
TemporarilyUndecryptableRowIsKept could not run. Move them, unchanged in
what they check, to components/flyweb_os_crypt as
FlyWebSQLiteCookieStoreTest.* with a fixture and test cryptor of their
own, and drop the net_unittests patch that only carried them.
